@page "/"

<PageTitle>Dynamite Doll Wrestling</PageTitle>

<h1 class="ddw-marquee">Dynamite Doll Wrestling</h1>
<p class="lead">
    A 2D all-female wrestling game for Windows PC, built in the spirit of the 1990 NES classic
    <em>WWF WrestleMania Challenge</em>, with on-chain Arcade1870 (A1870) rewards.
</p>

<div class="ddw-panel">
    <h3>Main Event</h3>
    <p>
        <strong>Bronwyne "The Dynamite Doll" Billington</strong> &mdash; real-life daughter of 1980s WWF tag team
        champion Tom "Dynamite Kid" Billington of the British Bulldogs &mdash; headlines the card and is the
        highest rated competitor in the game.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-danger" href="match">Enter the Ring</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="roster">View Roster</a>
</div>

<div class="ddw-panel">
    <h3>How a bout works</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Best of three falls, NES rules: chip the health meter, then cover for the three count.</li>
        <li>Grapples build momentum. Fill the momentum meter to unleash your signature finisher.</li>
        <li>When you are covered, mash an action key to kick out before the referee reaches three.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="ddw-panel">
    <h3>Crypto rewards</h3>
    <p>
        Completed matches are rewarded in <strong>Arcade1870 (A1870)</strong> using the same EIP-712 signed
        claim system as Crypto Hockey: the server signs a claim, and you submit it from MetaMask to the
        Arcade1870RewardVault contract.
    </p>
    <p class="small mb-0">
        Token contract:
        <a href="https://etherscan.io/token/0x8eddD4edea39c5B5f77662453600F53A202EE47C" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            0x8eddD4edea39c5B5f77662453600F53A202EE47C
        </a>
    </p>
</div>
